# Realtime chat

- Django Channels + Redis channel layer. Messages persisted in Postgres;
  connection state in Redis (keep app servers stateless).
- Connected users -> Direct Messages; unconnected -> Message Requests folder.
- Support text + image attachments, unread badges, blocking, push on new message.
- If chat throughput becomes a bottleneck, extract a dedicated async websocket
  service — but only when metrics justify it.